('Meysari Wine Tour (Min 6 Pax)','shamakhi','Entry Ticket ','- The Meysari Wine Tour offers a guided visit to one of Azerbaijan’s most renowned wineries, where guests can learn about local winemaking traditions and modern production techniques. The tour includes a walk through the vineyards and winery facilities, followed by a tasting of selected wines. A minimum of 6 participants is required to operate this tour, making it ideal for groups interested in experiencing Azerbaijani wine culture and local flavors together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,20,20,NULL),
('Savalan Wine Tour (Min 6 Pax)','shamakhi','Entry Ticket ','- The Savalan Wine Tour provides a guided visit to a premium winery set against scenic mountain landscapes, offering insight into Azerbaijan’s modern winemaking process. Guests explore the vineyards and production areas before enjoying a tasting of selected Savalan wines. A minimum of 6 participants is required for this tour, making it a perfect choice for groups seeking a relaxed and cultural wine experience',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,15,15,NULL),
('Alpaca Village ','shamakhi','Entry Ticket ','- Alpaca Village is a unique and family-friendly attraction where visitors can see, interact with, and take photos with gentle alpacas in a natural countryside setting. Guests can learn about these animals, feed them, and enjoy a calm, relaxing atmosphere away from the city. It is an ideal experience for families, animal lovers, and anyone looking for a peaceful and memorable activity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,21,21,NULL),
('Shamakhy Astrophysical Observatory named after Nasiruddin Tusi ','shamakhi','Entry Ticket','- This observatory is one of the leading scientific centers in the region, dedicated to astronomical research and education. Visitors can learn about stars, planets, and space through guided explanations, telescopes, and exhibitions, while also discovering the legacy of the famous scientist Nasiruddin Tusi. The visit offers an educational and inspiring experience, combining science, history, and panoramic mountain views.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,8,8,NULL),
('Samaxi Cuxuryurd Package','shamakhi','All Inclusive - Minimum 4 Pax','- The Samaxi Cuxuryurd Package offers a relaxing and immersive countryside experience in the picturesque region of Samaxi. Guests can enjoy guided tours of local vineyards, gardens, and cultural sites, participate in traditional activities, and savor authentic Azerbaijani cuisine. This package is ideal for those seeking a blend of nature, culture, and leisure, providing a memorable escape from the city.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,10,10,NULL),
